  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0018_6a0f0de7b212.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:3.31389in;height:1.40694in\" /></p><p>Let,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>D</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi>C</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> lies on <math><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math> is perpendicular to <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi></math> is perpendicular to <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Because <math><mi>D</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></math> so, the distance of <math><mi>D</mi></math> from <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is equal to <math><mi>D</mi><mi>C</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>25</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />Which represents parabola with focus <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and directrix is <math><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Length of the latus rectum&nbsp;is <math><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math>&nbsp;units</p>"
